          <li><strong>Apostille and legalisation</strong> (to use the divorce abroad): AED 500–1,500</li>
          <li><strong>English solicitor</strong> (if you have Part III MFPA 1984 or domicile considerations): GBP 5,000–20,000+ depending on complexity</li>
          <li><strong>Child psychologist report</strong> (sometimes ordered by court in custody disputes): AED 3,000–7,000</li>
